3	/**
4	 * Normalizes free-form postal address input into a canonical stored form.
5	 *
6	 * <p>Rules:
7	 * <ul>
8	 *   <li>Leading and trailing whitespace is trimmed and internal runs of whitespace
9	 *       are collapsed to a single space.</li>
10	 *   <li>The text is upper-cased.</li>
11	 *   <li>Common street-type abbreviations are expanded token-by-token:
12	 *       {@code ST -> STREET}, {@code RD -> ROAD}, {@code AVE -> AVENUE}.</li>
13	 * </ul>
14	 *
15	 * <p>For example {@code '  12  main  st '} becomes {@code '12 MAIN STREET'} and
16	 * {@code '7 elm ave'} becomes {@code '7 ELM AVENUE'}.
17	 */
